# AI assistant / agent tooling — per-developer settings and generated skills.
# CLAUDE.md, AGENTS.md, boost.json and .mcp.json are deliberately NOT ignored:
# they are portable, contain no secrets, and teammates rely on them.
# To share one agent directory anyway, use: /.claude/* then !/.claude/skills/
